  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2023 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A dual-ended brush that applies both creams and powders, sculpting and blending with ease for a softly defined look.<br><b><br>Brush Formulation:</b> All Formulas<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Brush Handle Length: </b>5\"<b><br><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The perfect tool to add soft definition to your cheekbones, jawline, and hairline, this dual-ended brush has both an angled, fan-shaped head and a fluffy powder head, allowing you to apply any formula you like while sculpting and shaping with ease.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the angled end to apply cream and to shape and define. <br>-Dust powder bronzer on with fluffy end, setting, blending, and bronzing where desired.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><